| \`/plan-review\` | Architecture | Challenge a plan with engineering rigor. |
| \`/new-feature <name>\` | Development | Scaffold a new feature across the relevant stack(s). |
| \`/commit\` | Development | Stage, validate, and create a conventional commit. |
| \`/self-review\` | Review | Run comprehensive self-review on current changes. |
| \`/iterate <component>\` | Development | Iterate on UI based on feedback — shows alternatives, saves preferences. |
| \`/sync-docs\` | Any | Comprehensive document sync — detects drift, updates all docs. |
| \`/local-setup\` | Any | Bootstrap, doctor, or reset the local dev environment. |
| \`/deploy\` | Deployment | Trigger a release workflow. |
| \`/design-review\` | Review UI changes against the design system quality bar. |
| \`/figma-sync\` | Sync components/tokens between code and Figma. |
| \`/figma-implement\` | Implement a Figma design as production code. |

## Sub-agents

| Agent | Model | Use for |
|-------|-------|---------|
| \`product-analyst\` | opus | Identifies requirement gaps, edge cases, missing business logic |
| \`phase-gate\` | sonnet | Validates phase completeness before transitions |
